---
layout: layouts/home.njk
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Home
  order: 1
numberOfLatestPostsToShow: 6
---
<section class="hero">
	<p class="hero-kicker">Antinode Labs</p>
	<h1>Engineering Beyond Peak.</h1>
	<p class="hero-lead">Don't just reach maximum amplitude, engineer what comes after. Essays on AI coding agents, software architecture and the craft of shipping.</p>
	{% set signupId = "home" %}
	{% include "signup.njk" %}
	<p class="hero-note">New here? <a href="/start-here/">Start with the essential reads &rarr;</a></p>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title">Latest posts</h2>
{% set latest = collections.posts | head(-1 * numberOfLatestPostsToShow) | reverse %}
<ul class="cards">
{%- for post in latest %}
	{%- set featured = loop.index <= 2 %}
	{% include "postcard.njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

{% set postsCount = collections.posts | length %}
{% set morePosts = postsCount - numberOfLatestPostsToShow %}
<p class="more-link">
	{%- if morePosts > 0 %}{{ morePosts }} more post{% if morePosts != 1 %}s{% endif %} in <a href="/blog/">the archive</a>.{% endif %}
</p>
